Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:53:50 +0800
Subject: drm/histb: vdp2: place the fetched window where the core clipped it

The core clips a plane before the channel is told where to put it.
Program the window at the clipped coordinates the core reports.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 2 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)


diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/histb/histb-vdp2-regs.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/histb/histb-vdp2-regs.h
